      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "A lengthy post, but I think I followed 100%. You make some great points. There needs to be some kind of impetus or vector for new users to discover that there is a way they're expected to behave (you know... not like a dick) when they're in VRC. This is one way to do it.\n\nI am more than positive that VRC administration is aware of the issues and is actively working on it. I hope they've got the bandwidth to take a breather and read your post in-depth, its a good one that-- while maybe not ever directly implemented as described-- makes a lot of good points about what the community would want this system to provide and do.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a3ae263a5dec273c4896823",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58c706f13b8e0378288be6e9",
