      "postID": "5a3ad7fd682bb9742d24a0f2",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'd like to see playermods with no recognition, who have the ability to hide their own avatar and nameplate, mute and globally hide avatars, and make higher priority reports. The playermods who are active, handle valid issues often, and do not abuse power would eventually be eligible to be promoted to a higher mod level, one that has a badge and would be a public presence for encouraging good behavior. The higher tier of mod would have the elevated access with more potential for abuse (seeing player reports, joining on usernames, and ignore room limits).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
