      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "The big keyword here for me is visible. That is absolutely the only way any form of community moderation can be down without being a privacy violation in my mind. Finding out that anyone for any reason was banned by a community moderator with no mod status would be something that would push me off this platform.",
      "viewerReactions": null
